    ],
    "packed_at": "2026-11-04",
    "note": "QC before seal: SN95FA182F56 New Black; USB-C charging cable present; carrying case present. Single-unit mailer sealed for carrier pickup same day."
  },
  "rationale": "Strip weight of corroborative force via arithmetic (70g ≠ ~20g case) and label-padding, reduce the photo to an unverified post-custody caption per the rulebook’s own manipulation warning, keep packing note strictly contemporaneous, and force Step-1 equipoise into AG5."
}

